  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx% of 280 = 15% of 240 + 20% of 310\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nx% of 280 = 15% of 240 + 20% of 310\n\n⇒ 2.8 x = (3/20) × 240 + (2 × 31)\n\n⇒ 2.8 x = 36 + 62\n\n⇒ x = 98/2.8 = 35\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 35.**",
